DESCRIPTION:In this talk\, I'll delve into my year as an open source intern
  at Pydantic\, offering insights from my experience at a quality-driven\, 
 community-centric company. I'll provide tips for aspiring contributors and
  discuss the value of early career development through open source involve
 ment.
